        "$id": "132",
        "$type": "FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.NoteFlowBlock, FlowBlox.Core",
        "Note": "DetailLevel is required and accepts only DescriptionAndMetadata (default) or DescriptionMetadataAndComments. The first mode does not request comments. The second loads every visible comment page and returns Comments rows containing TicketKey, CommentId, Author, Created, Updated and Body. No comments means no Comments rows. HTTP errors abort; a page limit stops rather than silently truncating the discussion.",
