        "$id": "133",
        "$type": "FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.NoteFlowBlock, FlowBlox.Core",
        "Note": "Output returns one ticket row. It shares the search metadata keys and adds Description, StoryPoints, Sprint and DetailLevel. Custom Story Points/Sprint IDs are discovered from Jira field definitions instead of hard-coded IDs. Missing optional metadata stays blank; unavailable StoryPoints is null. Description and comment Body retain Jira text/wiki markup. Attachments, worklogs and change history are intentionally not fetched.",
